    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a cornerstone of my academic journey, especially since pursuing my PhD in biology. I find solace in its precision and logic, using it daily to model biological systems or analyze data. While I don’t see myself as a mathematician, math is an indispensable tool in my work, blending creativity with analytical rigor.",
